==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[exclame]] {{defdate|16th-17th c.}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm}} {{term|exclamer}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|exclamare|exclāmāre|call out}}, from {{term|ex-}} + {{term|clamare|clāmāre|to call}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ɛkˈskleɪm/|/ɪkˈskleɪm/}}
* {{rhymes|eɪm}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{intransitive}} To [[cry out]] suddenly, from some strong emotion.

====Synonyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:shout]]

